{"id":"bd433626d0825ffc","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-normal-stable-system.md","title":"Type 1, Normal and Stable Provability Systems","display":"df-normal-stable-system — Type 1, Normal and Stable Provability Systems","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-normal-stable-system","aliases":["92-df-normal-stable-system"],"display":"df-normal-stable-system — Type 1, Normal and Stable Provability Systems","source":"第 XI 章 pp. 126–127（PDF 143–144）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-abstract-provability-system]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-normal-stable-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-normal-stable-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-normal-stable-system — Type 1, Normal and Stable Provability Systems"},{"key":"source","html":"第 XI 章 pp. 126–127（PDF 143–144）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7c85c79ae7f29681\" href=\"?note=7c85c79ae7f29681\" title=\"92-df-abstract-provability-system\">92-df-abstract-provability-system</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(S,f,\\Rightarrow,P,B)\">\\(M=(S,f,\\Rightarrow,P,B)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Taut}_M\">\\(\\mathrm{Taut}_M\\)</span> 来自<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7c85c79ae7f29681\" href=\"?note=7c85c79ae7f29681\" title=\"92-df-abstract-provability-system\">92-df-abstract-provability-system</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Type1},\\mathrm{NormalSys},\\mathrm{StableSys},\\mathrm{ConSys}\">\\(\\mathrm{Type1},\\mathrm{NormalSys},\\mathrm{StableSys},\\mathrm{ConSys}\\)</span> 为下文定义的结构谓词，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{consis}_M\\in S\">\\(\\mathrm{consis}_M\\in S\\)</span> 为一致性元素。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}normal\\text{-}stable\\text{-}system}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Type1}(M)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Taut}_M\\subseteq P\\land\\forall X,Y\\in S\\;\n(X\\in P\\land(X\\Rightarrow Y)\\in P\\Longrightarrow Y\\in P),\\\\\n\\mathrm{NormalSys}(M)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall X\\in P\\;BX\\in P,\\\\\n\\mathrm{StableSys}(M)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall X\\in S\\;(BX\\in P\\Longrightarrow X\\in P),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ConSys}(M)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow f\\notin P,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{consis}_M\\coloneqq\\neg_M(Bf).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}normal\\text{-}stable\\text{-}system}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Type1}(M)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Taut}_M\\subseteq P\\land\\forall X,Y\\in S\\;\n(X\\in P\\land(X\\Rightarrow Y)\\in P\\Longrightarrow Y\\in P),\\\\\n\\mathrm{NormalSys}(M)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall X\\in P\\;BX\\in P,\\\\\n\\mathrm{StableSys}(M)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall X\\in S\\;(BX\\in P\\Longrightarrow X\\in P),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ConSys}(M)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow f\\notin P,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{consis}_M\\coloneqq\\neg_M(Bf).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Normal 是可证性内化；Stable 是其元语言逆向封闭，不能误作系统证明每个反射实例 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"BX\\Rightarrow X\">\\(BX\\Rightarrow X\\)</span>。二者都不是序数函数的递增连续性。旧的序数条目保留为扩展材料，原书 normal 的系统意义由本节点给出。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 XI 章 pp. 126–127（PDF 143–144）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-abstract-provability-system","status":"resolved","id":"7c85c79ae7f29681","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-abstract-provability-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-abstract-provability-system","status":"resolved","id":"7c85c79ae7f29681","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Taut}_M$ 来自[[92-df-abstract-provability-system]]；$\\mathrm{Type1},\\mathrm{NormalSys},\\mathrm{StableSys},\\mathrm{ConSys}$ 为下文定义的结构谓词，$\\mathrm{consis}_M\\in S$ 为一致性元素。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M=(S,f,\\Rightarrow,P,B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Taut}_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Type1},\\mathrm{NormalSys},\\mathrm{StableSys},\\mathrm{ConSys}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{consis}_M\\in S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}normal\\text{-}stable\\text{-}system}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Type1}(M)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Taut}_M\\subseteq P\\land\\forall X,Y\\in S\\;\n(X\\in P\\land(X\\Rightarrow Y)\\in P\\Longrightarrow Y\\in P),\\\\\n\\mathrm{NormalSys}(M)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall X\\in P\\;BX\\in P,\\\\\n\\mathrm{StableSys}(M)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall X\\in S\\;(BX\\in P\\Longrightarrow X\\in P),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ConSys}(M)&\\Longleftrightarrow f\\notin P,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{consis}_M\\coloneqq\\neg_M(Bf).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"BX\\Rightarrow X","display":false}],"bytes":1693,"backlinks":[{"id":"cd8dcab3ce41cbc6","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书 representable in $S$ 指成员关系恰好对应正实例可证；本库旧 $\\mathrm{Rep}_G$ 指正负数码实例可证，即 proof-theoretic definability。参见[[92-df-smullyan-representability]]、[[92-df-complete-representability]]与[[92-df-representable]]。Normal/Stable 是元语言的可证性封闭性质，见[[92-df-normal-stable-system]]；序数正规函数另属扩展材料。"},{"id":"bb3ae520d70609fb","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ConSys},\\mathrm{StableSys}$ 的来源为 [[92-df-normal-stable-system]]。"},{"id":"5214366b706950b4","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"若另有 P⊆T，才得到原书定理1所需的“每个可证元素都真”。这种性质与 [[92-df-normal-stable-system]] 的 Stable 不同：Stable 限制可证集合的逆向闭包，TruthSet 限制外部解释。"},{"id":"aed464040ce8d4ec","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"该序数类函数定义保留，但未在本书定位到此定义。原书 normal 指 $X$ 可证则 $BX$ 可证的系统性质，见[[92-df-normal-stable-system]]。序数连续性、序数固定点与句法固定点没有同名推理桥梁。"},{"id":"3c0bfff14ec726c0","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Type1},\\mathrm{NormalSys}$ 来自[[92-df-normal-stable-system]]；$\\mathrm{Type4},\\mathrm{TypeG},\\mathrm{ReflexiveSys},\\mathrm{LobProperty}$ 是下文定义的结构谓词。"},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-106","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-abstract-provability-system]] → [[92-df-normal-stable-system]] → [[92-thm-abstract-stable-incompleteness]]。"},{"id":"c5f2d99ce132fb68","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{EnumMap}_M,\\mathrm{AdeqEnum}_M,\\mathrm{OmegaCon}_{M,\\Phi}$ 见枚举映射定义；$\\mathrm{Type1},\\mathrm{NormalSys},\\mathrm{StableSys},\\mathrm{ConSys}$ 见 [[92-df-normal-stable-system]]。"},{"id":"d4b1b39ab449a633","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f83c2c57795366ef","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"40e368f900e65306","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-111","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[92-df-normal-stable-system]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-113","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-normal-stable-system]]"}],"outgoing":["7c85c7